  530|       |            // at all) that would be.
  531|       |            //
  532|       |            // Another choice would be to lazily allocate the stacks, but...
  533|       |            // I'm not so sure about that. Seems like a fair bit of complexity?
  534|       |            //
  535|       |            // Maybe there's a simple solution I'm missing.
  536|       |            //
